<title>UK: Algeria's Skikda port still closed - official.</title>
<headline>Algeria's Skikda port still closed - official.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Skikda port remained closed for the second night on Wednesday due to bad weather, a port official told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said the port had closed on Tuesday morning and the weather forecast for Thursday was also not good.</p>
<p>&quot;We'll see what happens tomorrow but the forecast is still bad for the moment,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>The port closed for a week at the beginning of October, causing state oil company Sonatrach to issue a force majeure on two naphtha cargoes which loaded two weeks behind schedule in the end, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
